OL,3,GNEWSAMajor delays on M61 after reports
OL,4,Aof crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are facing delays on part of
OL,7,Fthe M61 after reports of a crash.
OL,9,FAll lanes on the southbound side of the
OL,10,Fmotorway have been blocked.
OL,12,FTraffic is at a standstill between
OL,13,Fjunction eight at Chorley, Lancashire,
OL,14,Fand junction six for Horwich, Bolton,
OL,15,FGreater Manchester, according to Inrix.
OL,17,FVehicles are backed up for four miles
OL,18,Fbetween Limbrick and Grimeford Village.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
